r greater efficiency.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_73","text":"None of the Big Three will want to bother with replacing the bodies of mass-produced Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_74","text":"...!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_75","text":"But that doesn't mean that we should throw up our hands and give up hope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_76","text":"Many Nikkes, ourselves included, have ventured out into these extreme conditions","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_77","text":"all in the name of ensuring humanity can live on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_78","text":"We can't let these Nikkes die a meaningless death out here without a chance to live on themselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_79","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_79","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_80","text":"That's why we're exhausting every last option at our disposal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_81","text":"For those with severe injuries,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_82","text":"we will transplant spare parts from the same model.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_83","text":"In this situation, the only viable transplants would be arms and legs. Appendages are fairly disconnected from the central nervous system.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_84","text":"Even then, their body may reject the new parts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_85","text":"They may feel as if a foreign object has been stuck to their body,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_86","text":"and this could result in a mental breakdown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_87","text":"However, if it means that there is a chance that they will survive,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_88","text":"no matter how small, we have to try.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_89","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_89","text":"Sounds like there'll be a tough journey ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_90","text":"It will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_91","text":"But if we were to give up now,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_92","text":"we would be doing a disservice to the sacrifices these Nikkes have made for us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_93","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_93","text":"Ludmilla stares at the rescue operation site.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_94","text":"There were six members in the squad in total.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_95","text":"Now we have three grievously injured Nikkes, and three with their brains inside the Brain Shelter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_06_e_96","text":"That tells me that each one of them took care of their comrades as they fell one by one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_06_e_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenar